## Worksheet

**F1 — Core loop**: `newGame()` builds single state `S`; `rnd(S)` mulberry32 used everywhere (no Math.random found); `endTurn()` resolves numbered steps 1-9 in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 — Map**: `for(y<8)for(x<8)` builds 8x8 grid; terrain from `rnd(S)`; `canBuild()` checks `b.terr.includes(tile.terr)`; `adj()` changes condenser/forge/generator output amounts. Score 2.

**F3 — Economy**: chains ore→metal (forge), water→soil→food (greenhouse), metal+power→parts (workshop); `cap()` enforces caps; step 8 logs+drops overflow. Score 2.

**F4 — Population**: colonist records `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,at}`; `workerMult()` reads skill and fatigue in production formula. Score 2.

**F5 — Needs**: `fNeed/wNeed` consumption; `S.shortF/shortW` triggers -12 morale; `workerMult` reads morale (refuse<25, -15% <50); morale recovers +4/turn when needs met. Score 2.

**F6 — Research**: 10 `RES_NODES`; `buyResearch()` enforces `n.pre`, deducts cost; each flag (`drills`,`hydro`,`turbines`,`smelt`,`fab`,`forecast`,`barter`,`logistics`) read in production/price/cap code. Score 2.

**F7 — Events**: 12 entries in `EVENTS`; weighted roll (`roll-=e.w`) among eligible; 4 events (refugees/sickness/mutiny/merchant) have 2-3 differing-outcome choices; `S.evcd[id]` cooldown filters `elig`. Score 2.

**F8 — Trade**: `price()` reads `S.r[g]/cap` and `market.drift[g]` (random-walk each turn); `market.stock/demand` limited and decremented; both buy/sell buttons wired. Score 2.

**F9 — Hazard**: storm every 7 turns, `sev` scales with turn; damaged tiles excluded from production loop (`!t.dmg`); `wall`/`forecast` reduce `mit`; repair costs 2 parts (`t.dmg=false`). Score 2.

**F10 — Save/load**: `saveStr()`/`loadStr()` via textarea; validates required fields and map length, shows error via `loadmsg`. Score 2.

**F11 — End conditions**: `checkEnd()` has reachable win (`turn>60&&pop>=12&&!shortF&&!shortW`) and lose (`col.length===0`); `score()` combines pop/research/stock/turns; summary table rendered on `G.over`. Score 2.

**F12 — UI**: `tab` switching via `TABS`/onclick; `logi()` stores turn `e.t` shown as `T'+e.t`; extensive `title=` tooltips; keydown handles Space+1-6; flex-wrap/minmax layout adapts (no explicit media query). Score 2.

**F13 — Dev panel**: `runTests()` 18 real invariant assertions (caps, prereqs, determinism, save/load); `runBench()`/`runHeadless()` run 200-turn headless sim via `policy()` printing `stateHash()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `S.research.drills` read in mine ore calc, `hydro` in greenhouse food, `turbines`/`smelt`/`fab` in generator/forge/workshop — all inside `endTurn()` production block. Score 4.

**G2**: `fNeed/wNeed` shortfall sets `shortF/shortW` → -12 morale to all colonists → `workerMult` zeroes/reduces output by morale. Full chain each turn. Score 4.

**G3**: storm sets `t.dmg=true` → production `tiles` filter excludes damaged → repair spends 2 parts and clears `dmg`, restoring output next turn. Score 4.

**G4**: `price()` formula uses `S.r[g]/cap(S,g)` (stockpile) and `S.market.drift[g]` (random-walk updated every `endTurn`). Score 4.

**G5**: refugees choices mutate `S.col`, `S.r.food/scrip`, morale differently per branch; mutiny sets `S.restDay=true` (skips next turn's production) vs scrip/morale changes — real state, not just log. Score 4.

